"encounter with information to help developers quickly diagnose and resolve "
"the issue. If you are a beginner following a tutorial and experience a "
"problem, for example, you can include the steps needed to reproduce the "
"problem. If you are a more experienced contributor, you can also provide "
"relevant technical details."
