#: ../../../source/The-ROS2-Project/Contributing.rst:273
msgid ""
"Reviewing a pull request involves carefully checking proposed documentation "
"changes to make sure the content is clear and correct. Anyone can review a "
"pull request. Reviewing a pull request is a great way to learn about ROS and "
